    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58064" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κλῶθες</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>, αἱ, <u>Spinners</u>, name of the <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Goddesses of fate</i>, 
